      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes, please, and some way to dismiss them from the \"Your Events\" section on the home page. I do not and never will care about \"Hazbin Hotel group (that has no connection to you) owner's 18th birthday\", or any other event from a group I'm not part of. If I wanted to know about these events, I would join the group for them. They take up massive amounts of space and increase the friction of using the calendar feature to the point I just don't bother looking at it.",
